      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → BytePlus → BytePlus Settings**.\n2. Describe your character in **Character**.\n3. Press **Run**. The 3D model is saved as a GLB file under `3d/byteplus`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
