        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedream 5.0 flash draws the character standing in a T-pose, from the front, on a plain white background, which Hyper3D turns into a clean 3D model."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
