            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Recover** is off when the workflow opens. Use it after you cancel a 3D task, after it times out, or after ComfyUI restarts while one runs.\n\n1. Select **Pose**, **3D: Generate**, and its **Save 3D Model**, and press Ctrl+B to turn them off, so they do not run and bill again.\n2. Select **3D: Download** and **Save 3D Model** here, and press Ctrl+B to turn them on.\n3. In `task`, choose the task, and press **Run** (press R to list tasks started after the page loaded)."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
